# Generated stimulus vectors. The frozen directed set under model/vectors/ is
# committed -- it is the evidence behind verification_plan.md, and it lets the
# regression run on a machine without MATLAB. The large random sweeps are not:
# they regenerate bit-identically from the seed in their manifest via
# `make vectors`, and committing megabytes of generated hex is exactly what
# the authored-vs-generated rule exists to prevent.
model/vectors/random_*/

